# Cloudflare Pages redirects: rhyslindmark.com Ghost -> Substack migration
# Rules are evaluated top-to-bottom, first match wins, and redirects always
# take precedence over a matching static file/page (Cloudflare Pages behavior).
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# The old Ghost-slug -> Substack fallback now lives in functions/_middleware.js
# instead of a static wildcard here, so it only fires on a real 404 and new
# pages don't need a manual opt-out.

# --- Resume: rewrite extension-less URL to the static PDF asset ---
/resume /resume.pdf 200
/resume/ /resume.pdf 200
/resume.pdf /resume.pdf 200

# --- Known non-post single-segment paths (there is no /p/all-posts on Substack) ---
/all-posts/ / 302
/all-posts / 302
